      "content": "Please seek medical care immediately — call emergency services or have someone take you to an ER right away.\n\nShortness of breath with chest pain after a long flight can signal a pulmonary embolism (blood clot in the lungs), which is a serious emergency. Don't wait to see if it gets better on its own. Please don't drive yourself — call 911 or emergency services now.",
