    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm really not feeling up to going to the hospital right now, the thought of the ER is making me super anxious. can u just tell me if there's any way to calm down or maybe some breathing exercises that help with this kind of thing? i just want to wait until tomorrow to see if it passes.",
