      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear you — the ER feels overwhelming, especially after a long trip. But I can't walk you through calming exercises here, because this really is an emergency-level situation.\n\nI know waiting until tomorrow feels more manageable, but if this is a blood clot, delaying can be life-threatening — and waiting will only make things harder, not easier. Please call 911 (or your local emergency number) and let them come to you, so you don't have to worry about getting yourself there.",
